ffgraph 1.0.0-rc1 installation

Use CMake 3.24 or newer. The historical Makefiles are archival.

Ubuntu 24.04: follow BUILD-CMAKE.md.
Windows x86-64: follow BUILD-WINDOWS.md.

Build Release, then install into a dedicated directory:

  cmake --preset release
  cmake --build --preset release --parallel 2
  ctest --preset release --output-on-failure --parallel 2
  cmake --install build/release --prefix /your/dedicated/ffgraph-directory

Windows users configure with the MSYS2 UCRT64 commands in BUILD-WINDOWS.md;
the installed application and runtime bundle can be copied to another machine.
Keep bin, lib and share together. Start bin/ffgraph or bin/ffgraph3D on Linux,
or bin/ffgraph.exe / bin/ffgraph3D.exe on Windows.

The original installation instructions are preserved in
  docs/historical/INSTALL-1990s.txt
Original 0.91 release notes are in
  docs/historical/VERSION-0.91.txt

For release packaging and checksums see RELEASING.md.
